    went = act === 'bring' ? 'Bringing it ' + (rec.day ? dayLong_(rec.day) : 'at the next room') + '. It is in This Week and on the facilitator’s desk now. It is not released to the men’s Readings.' : 'Not for the room. The Research Engine marks it, so it is not offered again.'; // build 36: at once, whatever its release state
